Z||000001||DottieB||07-29-2000||04:06 PM||||<BR>Robert,I think you are referring to POST NEW TOPIC at the top of any post.  If I am wrong, oh well, I tried.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Cliff Pennock||07-29-2000||05:11 PM||||If you are using Netscape, just click the "New Msg" button at the top of the screen. I would however change your email-address to a non-existing one. Newsgroups are often used to "mine" for email-addresses, so don't be suprised if you suddenly receive a lot of junk-email once you have posted to a newsgroup using a real email-address.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Robert||07-30-2000||12:07 AM||||What I am really looking to do is create a web page about all the weird benefits of WD-40.  I though if I could start a news group with WD-40 as the heading, I could generate some good responses.  Here is one group I belong to (alt.autos.fiero).  How did this heading first get started?<BR>Thanks all<BR>Robert<BR>||||reg||10
